        <mxCell id="KyTEPL8TXpAWPMXPdxUC-38" parent="KyTEPL8TXpAWPMXPdxUC-1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=5;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=0;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;spacing=0;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;以实测稳定接收速率 &lt;b style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;936 Mbits/sec&lt;/b&gt;（即有效应用层带宽 &lt;b style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;117,000,000 Bytes/sec&lt;/b&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;math-inline&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;$\approx$&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;111.58 MiB/s&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;）作为基准，如果在这条链路上跑你的网络服务（如 TCP 长连接 RPC、Muduo 网络库或音视频流），不同单包大小下的理论极限 &lt;b style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;QPS（每秒请求/响应数）&lt;/b&gt; 如下&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;网卡底层包转发率（PPS - Packets Per Second）&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-inline-start: 32px; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;标准以太网满载帧（MTU 1500，TCP 有效载荷 MSS = 1460 Bytes）&lt;/b&gt;：&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;math-block&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;$$\text{极限 PPS} = \frac{117,000,000 \text{ Bytes/sec}}{1460 \text{ Bytes}} \approx \mathbf{80,137 \text{ Packets/sec (约 8 万包/秒)}}$$&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;20 秒内累计收发标准数据包总数&lt;/b&gt;：约 &lt;b style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;160.2 万个&lt;/b&gt; TCP 满载数据包。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="540" x="3090" y="550" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="KyTEPL8TXpAWPMXPdxUC-39" parent="KyTEPL8TXpAWPMXPdxUC-1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=5;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=0;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;spacing=0;" value="&lt;h3&gt;业务层 QPS 容量预估（按单次请求+响应的报文总大小折算）&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;在实际写 C++ / 网络服务压测时，带宽上限决定的 &lt;b&gt;理论最高 QPS&lt;/b&gt; 取决于你的业务报文大小&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="61" width="540" x="3090" y="729" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="KyTEPL8TXpAWPMXPdxUC-40" parent="KyTEPL8TXpAWPMXPdxUC-1" style="shape=image;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/png,;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="520" width="746.42" x="2986.79" y="830" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
